        <mxCell id="source-scope-note" value="SOURCE_IMPLEMENTED_NOT_LIVE_ACCEPTED. Pet removal is the separate POST /pets/:id/archives command with CSRF/key/state/version guards; it is not a GET side effect. Read source/port lifeline groups the named query dependencies; it is not an invented runtime repository class. A read-only snapshot transaction, when used in source, does not imply a domain mutation, replay result store, ledger entry or money transfer. Sources: backend/src/routes/pet-care.routes.js; backend/src/controllers/pet-care.controller.js; backend/src/services/pet-care-management.service.js." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
